# FOLIAGE-WIND-POP: the edge of a crown swaying in the wind, against the sky, under TAA - four frames in a row must
# show the same leaf coverage (the owner 10-27: "the leaf edge is there, then it is not"), and the Velocity view
# must show the wind's motion on the crown (the wind is evaluated at the previous frame's time too).
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 40
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -1500,700,-3900
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0.05,-1
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 1_taa_a crown edge against the sky: leaves dense along the outline
Когда advance 0.02
Тогда-вид 2_taa_b the same outline as 1_taa_a, no leaves gone
Когда advance 0.02
Тогда-вид 3_taa_c the same outline as 1_taa_a, no leaves gone
Когда advance 0.02
Тогда-вид 4_taa_d the same outline as 1_taa_a, no leaves gone
Когда run View "View mode: Velocity"
Когда advance 0.02
Тогда-вид 5_vel the crown shows the wind's velocity (not zero) while the ground and the barn are still
